    <panel_attributes>GDS = housing / income &lt;= 39%
TDS = (housing + debt) / income &lt;= 44%
Marginal: within 3 points of a limit.
Housing = payment + 1%/yr tax + $100 heat.
Zero income: UNAFFORDABLE, ratios NaN.
